              {
                "text": "收到新的Empire Gold车牌后，您会先收到新的注册文件，然后再收到车牌。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Information about Empire Gold plates#1_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context states that new plates and registration documents are mailed separately, and in most cases you receive the registration document first."
              },
              {
                "text": "为避免交通罚单，即使新车牌尚未到达，也请将新的注册文件放置在您的车辆上。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Information about Empire Gold plates#1_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context explicitly instructs to place the new registration document in the vehicle to avoid tickets even if plates haven't arrived."
              },
              {
                "text": "收到新车牌后，请尽快将其安装在您的车辆上。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Information about Empire Gold plates#1_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context says to install the new plates as soon as possible after receiving them."
              },
              {
                "text": "旧车牌（如帝国蓝白车牌）请勿退回DMV，应根据当地指南回收，并在回收前用永久性墨水划掉车牌号码或污损车牌，分开处理以保护隐私。",
                "scope": "external_fact",
                "supported": true,
                "supporting_chunk_ids": [
                  "Information about Empire Gold plates#1_0::c0000"
                ],
                "reason": "The context instructs not to return old plates to DMV, recycle per local guidelines, deface with permanent ink, and dispose of separately for privacy."
              }
            ]
